# Only the per-user workspace image (deploy/workspace/Dockerfile) builds with
# this repo as the context. It needs just the openclaw artifact, so exclude
# everything else — notably deploy/authentik/data (root-owned docker volumes
# that the build can't even stat). Note: a sub-dir's own .dockerignore is NOT
# consulted, so openclaw/.dockerignore (which drops node_modules/dist) is
# bypassed and the COPYs below resolve.
*
!openclaw
